<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>IcantTapstrafe</Major>
    <Description>Hey everyone!
This macro allows you to swap weapons very easily.

Here is how it works:

1.Bind this macro on a key of your choice.
2.press the key once to switch the weapons 1 time.

Try the macro on the training ground first and i prefer using double shotgun ingame!!

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 50 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 50 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 50 ms
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 50 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 50 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
